#! case: a Director has no Goals
#! rule: R20_01-playbook-statement-in-director

GAME CUE alarm
GOAL hide
ACTION crouch

PLAYBOOK Hiding:
    TO hide: DO crouch.

PLOT Watch:
    PHASE calm INITIAL.

    DURING calm:
        WHEN alarm:
            PURSUE hide.                 #! error R20_01-playbook-statement-in-director
